// Resource script for the cao-gui exe (#471, #508): the shared application
// manifest plus the window and Explorer icon.
// 1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 = RT_MANIFEST. The icon keeps the
// C++ build's resource name, IDI_ICON1; `cao.ico` is a copy of the C++ tree's
// `src/styles/cao.ico`, kept here so it survives the C++ deletion (#515).
1 24 "Cathedral_Assets_Optimizer.manifest"
IDI_ICON1 ICON "cao.ico"
